efficiency_sweep.py: Simulink PI steady state (dataset-era model), HV -> LV, constant-D0 levels bracketing |P|, all quantities interpolated in the measured delivered power. eta = |P| / (|P| + loss), loss = Pin - Pd.
dIpk, dloss = SPS - controller (positive = better than SPS); deta in percentage points; * = oscillation (|mean i_L| > 20 mA in this run or its SPS reference); '-' = not bracketed yet

